Alhamdulillah, as we enter the middle of 2026, several of my main projects remain stable and continue to receive updates. Here is a status summary for these projects:

### 1. mPaD (Mitrapad Ecosystem)
**Status: Running**
This local tax and retribution management system is currently in full operational phase. We continue to perform routine maintenance and feature adjustments based on field feedback to ensure smooth H2H integration with banking systems.

### 2. Aindea (Asisten Digital Bahasa Wolio)
**Status: Running**
This AI-based cultural preservation project has received positive responses. We are currently fine-tuning its Hybrid AI model to improve translation accuracy and achieve a deeper understanding of Buton's cultural context.

### 3. Personal Portfolio (muhdanfyan.github.io)
**Status: Running**
This website itself is constantly updated to reflect my latest achievements and projects. I have added status labels to each portfolio item to provide transparency regarding the development progress.

Thank you for your support!
